### Inside fdisk:

| Command | Meaning               |
| ------- | --------------------- |
| `n`     | Create new partition  |
| `p`     | Primary partition     |
| `e`     | Extended partition    |
| `d`     | Delete partition      |
| `t`     | Change partition type |
| `w`     | Write changes         |
| `q`     | Quit without saving   |

📌 **Important**

