## 🔹 LVM Architecture (IMPORTANT)

```
Disk → PV → VG → LV → FileSystem → Mount
```

---

### 🔹 Step 1: Create Physical Volume (PV)

```bash
pvcreate /dev/sdc
```

Check:

```bash
pvs
```

---

### 🔹 Step 2: Create Volume Group (VG)

```bash
vgcreate vgdata /dev/sdc
```

Check:

```bash
vgs
```


sudo pvcreate /dev/sdb1 /dev/sdb2
sudo vgextend myvg /dev/sdb1 /dev/sdb2
