```

Check:

```bash
lvs
```

---

### 🔹 Step 4: Create filesystem on LV

```bash
mkfs.ext4 /dev/vgdata/lvapp
```

or

```bash
mkfs.xfs /dev/vgdata/lvapp
```

---

### 🔹 Step 5: Mount LVM

```bash
mkdir /app
mount /dev/vgdata/lvapp /app
```

---

### 🔹 Step 6: Permanent Mount (fstab)

```bash
blkid /dev/vgdata/lvapp
```

Add:

```bash
UUID=lv-uuid   /app   ext4   defaults   0   0
```

Test:

```bash
mount -a
```

---

## PART-5️⃣ ADVANCED LVM OPERATIONS (VERY IMPORTANT FOR JOBS)

---

### 🔹 Extend Logical Volume (LIVE)

```bash
lvextend -L +5G /dev/vgdata/lvapp
```

Resize filesystem:

#### ext4

```bash
resize2fs /dev/vgdata/lvapp
```

#### xfs

```bash
