```

✔️ No downtime required

---

### 🔹 Reduce Logical Volume (DANGEROUS ⚠️)

```bash
umount /app
e2fsck -f /dev/vgdata/lvapp
resize2fs /dev/vgdata/lvapp 15G
lvreduce -L 15G /dev/vgdata/lvapp
mount /app
```

---

### 🔹 LVM Snapshot (Backup use)

```bash
lvcreate -s -n snap_app -L 2G /dev/vgdata/lvapp
```

---

