## 5️⃣ Advanced Multi-User + DB Backup Combined Script

```bash
#!/bin/bash

# --- Multi-user creation ---
USERLIST="/path/users.txt"
DEFAULT_PASS="Welcome123"

while IFS= read -r user; do
